WEBVTT

00:02:58.871 --> 00:03:02.056
in the democratic miracle
of the Arab Spring.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:06.473
We saw dictators fall,
we saw others hang on.

00:03:06.497 --> 00:03:08.589
(Laughter)

00:03:09.107 --> 00:03:13.014
And then there is the timeless
Kim dynasty of North Korea.

00:03:13.038 --> 00:03:16.369
These guys seem to be coming
straight out of Cartoon Network.

00:03:16.393 --> 00:03:19.488
I was blessed to be able
to draw two of them.

00:03:19.512 --> 00:03:21.265
Kim Jong-il, the father,

00:03:21.289 --> 00:03:24.607
when he died a few years ago,
that was a very dangerous moment.

00:03:24.631 --> 00:03:25.824
[That was close!]

00:03:25.848 --> 00:03:28.471
(Laughter)

00:03:28.495 --> 00:03:29.699
That was --

00:03:29.723 --> 00:03:32.643
(Applause)